          ],
          "guidance": {
            "inspection": "Read each return or destruction duty with its governing trigger. Support the hypothesis only when termination, expiry, completion, abandonment, or rejection of the relationship activates disposition; a request-only duty does not establish disposition upon termination. Retain all operative alternatives, objects, timing, and qualifying lead-ins.",
