          "hypothesis_ids": [
            "nda-1"
          ],
          "guidance": {
            "inspection": "Reconstruct the identification rule for every form of protected information. Entailment requires identification by the disclosing party across the definition's full scope; an alternative based on circumstances, reasonable understanding, or what the recipient should know defeats the universal requirement. Preserve form-specific timing and written-confirmation conditions.",
