          "guidance": {
            "inspection": "Read only definitional or inclusion language that establishes protected subject matter. Decide whether non-technical categories are affirmatively included; business, financial, marketing, personnel, contact, or general commercial information opposes a technical-only definition. Do not use exclusions, use restrictions, or an unconnected actor mention as definitional evidence.",
